Package: amanuensis
Title: Turn Scanned Historical Documents into Data with Gemini
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Marcelo", "Pi-Suñer", email = "marce.pisuner@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A friendly workflow for turning photographs and scans of
    historical sources (rosters, ledgers, censuses, letters, printed tables)
    into tidy data. A vision language model (Google Gemini) reads each page
    image and returns records that follow a codebook you write in a
    spreadsheet; the package handles the images, the API calls, resuming
    interrupted runs, validation, costs, export to Excel/Stata/CSV/Word, and
    measuring accuracy against a hand-made gold standard.
